{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id685931431"}, "name":{"label":"Ldy_tracer"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-26T07:58:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13678205607"}, "title":{"label":"Keeps crashing"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this game a couple days ago and I fell in love playing this game. I have it on my iphone and iPad. I have not encountered any problems when playing it on my phone but whenever it’s played on the iPad the game goes black and I end up loosing all what I’ve gained on the day. I tried restarting my iPad, updated all the apps, my software on my iPad is up to date, but nothing seems to fix it:( I would have given it a five star review but since it’s not working on my iPad then I ran out of options on what to do. Any idea what I can do?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id482461064"}, "name":{"label":"misery420"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-25T07:38:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13674435025"}, "title":{"label":"iOS co-op Bug Report"}, "content":{"label":"First off let me just say this game is 11/10! Absolutely love. I’ve just taught my son how to play this game as well. And we are playing on the experimental iOS co-op and have found a minor issue in that when we are mining or in other rare occurrences the farmhand will freeze and be unable to move and has to quit and log back in again. And after a handful of times gets a little bothersome. No issues with the host so far but the person that joins has some freezing issues when in the mines I’m noticing most but will be happy to let you know if I encounter more issues. I can tell it’s still being worked on and I love it. I want to see it continue to grow and get better. Thank you for making such a wonderful game !!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
